    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been getting those kidney stones again lately and its driving me crazy. i read that vitamin c is great for detoxing and boosting the immune system so i was thinking about starting a high dose regimen, maybe like 2500mg or 3000mg a day to really flush my system out. do u think that would help with my kidney health?",
